#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-driver-offer:51
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:781
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-firstrun:895
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-hub:25
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-setup:17
msgid "Press Enter to close..."
msgstr "Pressione Enter para fechar..."

#. TRANSLATORS: 'Finish Setup' is the launcher entry the owner searches for —
#. use the same words as the Name= of dagric-setup.desktop in your language.
#. 'sudo dagric-drivers' is a command typed verbatim; do not translate it.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-driver-offer:56
msgid "NVIDIA graphics detected"
msgstr "Placa de vídeo NVIDIA detectada"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-driver-offer:57
msgid ""
"Dagric found an NVIDIA graphics card.\n"
"\n"
"Install the NVIDIA proprietary driver now for the best performance and\n"
"battery life?\n"
"\n"
"You can always do this later — search 'Finish Setup' in the launcher, or\n"
"run 'sudo dagric-drivers' in a terminal."
msgstr ""
"O Dagric encontrou uma placa de vídeo NVIDIA.\n"
"\n"
"Instalar agora o driver proprietário da NVIDIA, para o melhor desempenho e "
"maior\n"
"duração de bateria?\n"
"\n"
"Você sempre pode fazer isso depois — procure por \"Concluir configuração\" "
"no menu\n"
"de aplicativos, ou rode \"sudo dagric-drivers\" num terminal."

#. TRANSLATORS: "sudo dagric-drivers" is a command typed verbatim.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:16
msgid "Run with sudo: sudo dagric-drivers"
msgstr "Execute com sudo: sudo dagric-drivers"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:20
msgid "Dagric driver check"
msgstr "Verificação de drivers do Dagric"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:23
msgid "NVIDIA GPU detected:"
msgstr "Placa de vídeo NVIDIA detectada:"

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:35
msgid ""
"Install NVIDIA's proprietary driver from the system's non-free repository? "
"[y/N]"
msgstr ""
"Instalar o driver proprietário da NVIDIA do repositório non-free do sistema?"
" [s/N]"

#. TRANSLATORS: this warns that skipping the enrollment step
#. leaves the machine at a BLACK SCREEN after reboot. Keep that
#. consequence explicit — it is the whole point of the notice.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:51
msgid ""
"NOTE: Secure Boot is ON. The NVIDIA driver builds a kernel\n"
"module that must be signed and enrolled, or it won't load\n"
"(black screen). Dagric will set up the signing key and ask\n"
"you to enroll it — you'll finish that at the next reboot."
msgstr ""
"OBSERVAÇÃO: o Secure Boot está LIGADO. O driver da NVIDIA compila um módulo\n"
"do kernel que precisa ser assinado e registrado, senão não carrega (tela\n"
"preta). O Dagric vai preparar a chave de assinatura e pedir que você a\n"
"registre — isso é concluído na próxima reinicialização."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:84
msgid ""
"Could not reach the package servers.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing was changed — try again when you are back online."
msgstr ""
"Não foi possível acessar os servidores de pacotes.\n"
"\n"
"Nada foi alterado — tente de novo quando voltar a ter internet."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:140
msgid ""
"Could not work out which NVIDIA driver this card needs.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing has been installed, and your screen keeps working on the open-source"
"\n"
"driver it is using now. Installing the wrong branch would disable that "
"driver\n"
"and could leave you with a black screen, so this stops instead of guessing.\n"
"\n"
"Check your connection and try again — or report the card at\n"
"https://dagric.com/support and we will tell you which driver it takes."
msgstr ""
"Não foi possível descobrir de qual driver da NVIDIA esta placa precisa.\n"
"\n"
"Nada foi instalado, e sua tela continua funcionando com o driver de código\n"
"aberto que ela usa agora. Instalar a versão errada desativaria esse driver\n"
"e poderia deixar você com a tela preta, então isto para em vez de adivinhar."
"\n"
"\n"
"Verifique sua conexão e tente de novo — ou informe a placa em\n"
"https://dagric.com/support e dizemos qual driver ela pede."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:207
msgid ""
"The driver did not install.\n"
"\n"
"The open-source driver has been left switched on, so your screen keeps "
"working.\n"
"If you were offline, try again when you are back online; otherwise report "
"the\n"
"card at https://dagric.com/support and we will tell you which driver it "
"takes."
msgstr ""
"O driver não foi instalado.\n"
"\n"
"O driver de código aberto foi deixado ligado, então sua tela segue "
"funcionando.\n"
"Se você estava sem internet, tente de novo quando voltar; caso contrário,\n"
"informe a placa em https://dagric.com/support e dizemos qual driver ela pede."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:239
msgid ""
"WARNING: the NVIDIA kernel module did not finish building.\n"
"The open-source driver has been switched back on, so the screen still works\n"
"after a reboot. Re-run this helper afterwards and it will report what went\n"
"wrong."
msgstr ""
"ATENÇÃO: o módulo de kernel da NVIDIA não terminou de compilar.\n"
"O driver de código aberto foi religado, então a tela continua funcionando\n"
"depois de reiniciar. Rode este assistente de novo em seguida e ele vai dizer"
"\n"
"o que deu errado."

#. TRANSLATORS: 'MOK Management', 'Enroll MOK' and 'Continue' are
#. the literal words on the blue firmware screen at the next
#. boot. That screen is ENGLISH ONLY and cannot be translated, so
#. these three must stay in English or the owner will hunt for a
#. button that is not there. Everything around them should be
#. translated.
#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:260
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT — finish Secure Boot enrollment:\n"
"  1. Reboot now.\n"
"  2. At the blue 'MOK Management' screen, choose\n"
"     'Enroll MOK' -> 'Continue' and enter the password\n"
"     you were just asked for.\n"
"  3. The system boots into the NVIDIA driver.\n"
"If you skip this, the driver won't load and you'll fall\n"
"back to the open-source driver. You can re-run this anytime."
msgstr ""
"IMPORTANTE — conclua o registro do Secure Boot:\n"
"  1. Reinicie agora.\n"
"  2. Na tela azul 'MOK Management', escolha\n"
"     'Enroll MOK' -> 'Continue' e digite a senha\n"
"     que acabou de ser pedida.\n"
"  3. O sistema inicia com o driver da NVIDIA.\n"
"Se você pular isso, o driver não vai carregar e você volta para o\n"
"driver de código aberto. Pode executar isto de novo quando quiser."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:269
msgid "Done. Reboot to switch to the NVIDIA driver."
msgstr "Pronto. Reinicie para mudar para o driver da NVIDIA."

#: config/includes.chroot/usr/bin/dagric-drivers:275
msgid ""
"No NVIDIA GPU found. AMD and Intel graphics use the built-in\n"
"open-source drivers — nothing to install."
msgstr ""
"Nenhuma placa NVIDIA encontrada. As placas AMD e Intel usam os drivers de\n"
"código aberto já incluídos — não há nada para instalar."

